# Rebuild frontend after code changes

Do not treat `npm run dev` / Vite `:5173` as the way to show frontend changes.

After finishing code changes:

1. Rebuild the frontend: `npm run build` in `web/` (writes `web/dist`).
2. Do **not** start or restart the Go backend (`go run ./cmd/server`, etc.). The user runs the server themselves.

If `:8080` is already serving an older `web/dist`, the user will restart it when they want the new build.
